<title>USA: BADMINTON-THURSDAY'S RESULTS AT U.S. OPEN.</title>
<headline>BADMINTON-THURSDAY'S RESULTS AT U.S. OPEN.</headline>
<dateline>ORANGE, California 1996-09-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results at the</p>
<p>U.S.Open Badminton Championships on Thursday (prefix number</p>
<p>denotes seeding):</p>
<p>Men's singles</p>
<p>1-Joko Suprianto (Indonesia) beat Ong Ewe Hock (Malaysia)</p>
<p>15-8 3-15 15-12</p>
<p>Fung Permadi (Taiwan) beat Thomas Stuer-Lauridsen (Denmark)</p>
<p>8-15 15-8 15-12</p>
<p>Rashid Sidek (Malaysia) beat Hwang Sun Ho (South Korea) 15-5</p>
<p>15-7</p>
<p>2-Poul-Erik Hoyer-Larsen (Denmark) beat Budi Santoso</p>
<p>(Indonesia) 15-11 15-6</p>
<p>Women's singles</p>
<p>1-Mia Audina (Indonesia) beat Kara Solmundsen (Canada) 11-2</p>
<p>11-0</p>
<p>Denyse Julien (Canada) beat Kim Sun Suk (South Korea) 11-2</p>
<p>11-1</p>
<p>Meiluawaty (Indonesia) beat Debra O'Conner (Trinidad and</p>
<p>Tobago) 11-7 11-1</p>
<p>2-Camilla Martin (Denmark) beat Cindy Shi (U.S.) 11-4 11-4</p>
<p>Men's doubles</p>
<p>1-Antonius/Denny Kartono (Indonesia) beat Lee Wan Wah/Choong</p>
<p>Tan Fook (Malaysia) 18-14 16-18 15-2</p>
<p>Chandra Wijaya/Sigit (Indonesia) beat Nickolai Zuev/Andrej</p>
<p>Antropov (Russia) 15-8 15-1</p>
<p>Ha Tae Kwon/Kim Dong Mun (South Korea) beat Rudy Wijaya/Tony</p>
<p>Gunawan (Indonesia) 18-14 18-17</p>
<p>2-Yap Kim Hock/Cheah Soon Kit (Malaysia) beat Chris</p>
<p>Hunt/Simon Archer (Britain) 15-9 15-1</p>
<p>Women's doubles</p>
<p>1-Eliza/Rosiana Zelin (Indonesia) beat Lena</p>
<p>Jansen(Sweden)/Charmaine Reid (Canada) 15-4 15-2</p>
<p>Kim Shin Young/Chung So Young (South Korea) beat Si-An</p>
<p>Deng/Denyse Julien (Canada) 11-15 15-8 15-10</p>
<p>Indarti Isoliana/Deyana Lomban (Indonesia) beat Robbyn</p>
<p>Hermitage/Milaine Cloutier (Canada) 15-7 15-2</p>
<p>2-Joanne Goode/Julie Bradbury (Britain) beat Ella Karachkova</p>
<p>(Russia)/Jody Patrick (Canada) 15-0 15-4</p>
<p>Mixed doubles</p>
<p>Nick Ponting/Joanne Goode (Britain) beat Darryl Yung/Denyse</p>
<p>Julien (Canada) 15-7 15-7</p>
<p>2-Simon Archer/Julie Bradbury (Britain) beat</p>
<p>Sandiarto/Indarti Isoliana (Indonesia) 12-15 15-11 15-9</p>
<p>:</p>
<p>Add mixed doubles</p>
<p>Kim Dong Mun/Chung So Young (South Korea) beat 2-Nimpele</p>
<p>Flandy/Rosalina Riseu (Indonesia) 18-16 15-8</p>
<p>Chris Hunt (Britain)/Helene Kirkegaard (Denmark) beat Ha Tae</p>
<p>Kwon/Kim Shin Young (South Korea) 15-2 15-11</p>
</text>
